  "prompt": "Cho hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Vẽ đồ thị hàm số đã cho.</li><li>Tìm các giá trị của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tìm các giá trị của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tìm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>m</mi></semantics></math> để có bốn giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> phân biệt thỏa mãn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
