  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có đồ thị của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên đọan <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> như sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/5c826b78ea03ee6d2529c3d881589b97acbcc414df1230e31e4feae8fcdb0015.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></li><li>Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ đồ thị của hàm số ở trên, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ đồ thị của hàm số ở trên, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Có bốn giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thỏa mãn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math> khi và chỉ khi đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cắt đồ thị hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tại bốn điểm. Từ đồ thị hàm số ở trên, ta thấy điều này xảy ra khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
